{"version":1,"content":"<p>近年韓牛料理愈趨精緻，糅合西式烹調技巧與創意元素，帶來嶄新味覺體驗。</p><p>首爾有兩間人氣餐廳，一間深得韓星青睞、主打Fine Dining級數的無菜單料理；</p><p>另一間則以多種手法演繹牛肉風味。</p><p>本地亦有由首爾頂級名店班底主理、融合港式茶餐廳元素的食府，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T12:21:09.969865+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:12.805906+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:12.805906+00:00","content_hash":"e5c262a055fc3e9ee7b92870b5da9fc7cc4301bd6f3f9b304fc01b359fca209e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}